<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<!--
		ExportOptions.plist — konfigurasi signing untuk `flutter build ipa` /
		`xcodebuild -exportArchive`. File ini dipakai saat export archive ke .ipa
		yang siap upload ke App Store Connect.

		--- CARA PAKAI ---

		1. Ganti placeholder di bawah dengan nilai asli Anda:
		   - TEAM_ID        → Team ID akun Apple Developer Anda (10 karakter,
		                      contoh: A1B2C3D4E5). Cek di
		                      https://developer.apple.com/account -> Membership.
		   - PROVISIONING_PROFILE_UUID → UUID App Store provisioning profile
		                      untuk bundle id.sagansa.app. Didapat dari
		                      https://developer.apple.com/account/resources/profiles
		                      atau Xcode -> Settings -> Accounts -> Download Manual Profile.

		2. Alternatif lebih mudah: pakai automatic signing lewat Xcode
		   (Runner -> Signing & Capabilities -> centang "Automatically manage
		   signing" -> pilih Team). Xcode akan buat profile otomatis, dan Anda
		   bisa skip file ini (archive langsung dari Xcode Organizer).

		3. Untuk build via command line setelah profile manual tersedia:
		     flutter build ipa --export-options-plat ios/ExportOptions.plist
		   atau
		     flutter build ipa --export-options-plat=ios/ExportOptions.plist

		Method "app-store" = untuk upload ke App Store Connect / TestFlight.
		Method "ad-hoc" / "development" = untuk testing terbatas (ganti nilai di bawah).
	-->
	<key>method</key>
	<string>app-store</string>
	<key>teamID</key>
	<string>TEAM_ID</string>
	<key>uploadBitcode</key>
	<false/>
	<key>uploadSymbols</key>
	<true/>
	<key>compileBitcode</key>
	<false/>
	<key>signingStyle</key>
	<string>manual</string>
	<key>provisioningProfiles</key>
	<dict>
		<key>id.sagansa.app</key>
		<string>PROVISIONING_PROFILE_UUID</string>
	</dict>
</dict>
</plist>
